ohc=VUMaIPa9IVMQ7kNvwGiExO3&_nc_oc=Ado5I55c71D_DV9JyAUHgpcDqXfjZNftbWnAwnYsP9ILPS99gvQrHDX7GQ1pUOr6Cu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRJSC-l-uMy5gJ969HwY0hZwPolauYfeWiPuKkJwmziDw&oe=6AFF1B9B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BannerBB_2.png", "id": "1252391646644285", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824081_1252391649977618_8052090914367398690_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zAAG06AndWYQ7kNvwFulc9S&_nc_oc=AdooaNLAw795rhxF7vGE8BZkqNOrGD2RfIJFSoN3lKgShqMscUH4_yPmmCZU2wyKiag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQHzb52WafatG_jdG7mhfUPVakZH8ROzuPtQW8cst1Pwg&oe=6AFF23CD"}, "display_name": "Baby Boom", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Baby Boom** is a cozy mixed-reality life sim where you care for a little space baby right in your room. Reach out with your hands to feed, entertain, rock, and dress him\u2014no controllers needed. Unlock outfits and enjoy bite-size mini-games that fit perfectly into short sessions.\n\n{1804321480451609}\n\n# What you\u2019ll do\n\n-  Care & bond: Feed bottles, rock to sleep, cheer him up.\n\n-  Play together: Quick, silly mini-games that make the baby giggle.\n\n- Dress-up: Mix and match adorable outfits and space-themed accessories.\n\n- Hand-tracking: Natural, intuitive interactions with your own hands.\n\n\nWholesome, relaxing, and kid-friendly. No violence or scary content\u2014just sweet moments and gentle humor.\n\nYour little one is already waiting! \ud83d\udc76\u2728\n", "short_description": "Care for a tiny space baby in mixed reality! Play games, feed him, and dress him in cute outfits. Hand-tracking controls make everything feel natural\u2014no controllers needed. Relaxing, funny, and wholesome fun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://babyboomar.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name":